      en: ["The area was officially declared a white group area on 11 February 1966.", "More than 60,000 residents were forcibly removed from their homes.", "The District Six Museum was established in December 1994.", "The building used is the historic former Methodist Mission Church.", "It was designated as a National Heritage Site in 2003.", "The museum's collection includes over 500 original street signs."],
