      en: ["Occupation period: Circa 1400 to 1823 AD.", "Estimated population in 1820: Between 16,000 and 20,000 people.", "Visited and documented by missionary John Campbell in May 1820.", "The city was destroyed during the Mfecane period around 1823.", "The ruins are situated near the modern-day town of Zeerust.", "Evidence shows large-scale smelting of copper and iron at the site."],
      es: ["Superficie: ~20 hectáreas", "Declarado monumento nacional: 1938", "Periodo: siglos XVI-XIX", "Hallazgos: Cuentas de vidrio de Europa y Asia", "Población máxima: ~10.000", "Altura de los muros: hasta 2 metros"],
      pt: ["Área: ~20 hectares", "Declarado monumento nacional: 1938", "Período: séculos XVI-XIX", "Achados: Contas de vidro da Europa e Ásia", "População máxima: ~10.000", "Altura dos muros: até 2 metros"],
      fr: ["Superficie : ~20 hectares", "Classé monument national : 1938", "Période : XVIe-XIXe siècles", "Découvertes : Perles de verre d'Europe et d'Asie", "Population maximale : ~10 000", "Hauteur des murs : jusqu'à 2 mètres"],
