      en: ["Hector Pieterson was one of the first victims killed during the uprising on June 16, 1976.", "The memorial was officially opened on June 16, 2002, the 26th anniversary of the event.", "The adjacent museum documents the causes and global impact of the Soweto Uprising.", "June 16th is now celebrated as a national public holiday, Youth Day, in South Africa.", "The slate stones used in the memorial were sourced from different parts of the country.", "The famous photograph by Sam Nzima was captured using a Pentax camera."],
      es: ["Inauguración: 16 de junio de 2002", "Edad de Hector Pieterson: 12 años", "Fecha del levantamiento: 16 de junio de 1976", "El museo alberga más de 1000 artefactos", "La famosa foto fue tomada por Sam Nzima", "Situado en la esquina de las calles Moema y Khumalo"],
