      en: ["The Old Fort was originally built in 1893 as a prison for white male inmates.", "Mahatma Gandhi was imprisoned here in 1908 for his campaign of passive resistance.", "Nelson Mandela was held here in 1962 while awaiting the Rivonia Trial.", "The Constitutional Court was officially opened on Human Rights Day, March 21, 2004.", "The 'Eternal Flame of Democracy' has been burning at the site since 2011.", "Number 4 was the specific section used for black male prisoners during apartheid."],
      es: ["El Tribunal Constitucional se inauguró en 1995.", "El Old Fort se construyó en 1892.", "Nelson Mandela estuvo encarcelado en el Old Fort en 1941.", "La Prisión de Mujeres se construyó en 1909.", "Number Four se construyó en 1901.", "Constitution Hill se abrió al público en 2004."],
