      en: ["The cave extends horizontally for 139 meters into the hillside.", "Evidence of controlled fire at the site has been dated to 1 million years ago.", "Fossil remains of extinct species, such as giant zebras, have been found inside.", "The first formal archaeological excavations were conducted in the 1940s.", "Engraved pieces of ochre found in the cave suggest early symbolic expression.", "The site is located in the Kuruman Hills between the towns of Kuruman and Danielskuil."],
      es: ["La cueva contiene una secuencia sedimentaria de 2 millones de años.", "El uso temprano del fuego data de hace 1,8 millones de años.", "La cueva tiene 140 metros de largo.", "Fue declarada monumento nacional en 1993.", "Se encontraron herramientas de las culturas Olduvayense y Achelense.", "La cueva está cerca de Danielskuil."],
      pt: ["A caverna contém uma sequência sedimentar de 2 milhões de anos.", "O uso precoce do fogo data de 1,8 milhões de anos atrás.", "A caverna tem 140 metros de comprimento.", "Foi declarada monumento nacional em 1993.", "Foram encontradas ferramentas das culturas Olduvaiense e Achelense.", "A caverna fica perto de Danielskuil."],
      fr: ["La grotte contient une séquence sédimentaire vieille de 2 millions d'années.", "L'utilisation précoce du feu remonte à 1,8 million d'années.", "La grotte mesure 140 mètres de long.", "Elle a été déclarée monument national en 1993.", "Des outils des cultures oldowayenne et acheuléenne y ont été trouvés.", "La grotte se trouve près de Danielskuil."],
